NIVUUS-CI-FIXTURE - THIS IS NOT A WINDOWS MEDIUM.

This file exists only so the `package / Package contract` CI gate
(nivuus/.github ci-package.yml, via scripts/check-idempotence.sh and
console/hooks/install.py) has something to `stat()` and copy when it proves
the console install hook is idempotent. It is referenced by the
`windows_iso` answer in console/tests/fixtures/ci-answers.json.

Do not point a real install at this file - it contains no bootable content
and installing from it will fail immediately.
